{"id":"forecast-13","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-13/audio-3.mp3","model":"small","duration":448.67,"segments":[{"start":0.34,"end":7.22,"text":"Part 3. You will hear two business students called Janet and Michael discussing their","words":[["Part",0.34,0.86],["3.",0.86,1.26],["You",2.14,2.56],["will",2.56,2.72],["hear",2.72,2.98],["two",2.98,3.3],["business",3.3,3.7],["students",3.7,4.22],["called",4.22,4.74],["Janet",4.74,5.16],["and",5.16,5.48],["Michael",5.48,5.84],["discussing",5.84,6.78],["their",6.78,7.22]]},{"start":7.22,"end":13.68,"text":"research into the marketing of different kinds of shampoo. First you have some time to look","words":[["research",7.22,7.7],["into",7.7,7.98],["the",7.98,8.14],["marketing",8.14,8.5],["of",8.5,8.86],["different",8.86,9.18],["kinds",9.18,9.72],["of",9.72,9.86],["shampoo.",9.86,10.3],["First",11.58,12.28],["you",12.28,12.54],["have",12.54,12.7],["some",12.7,12.88],["time",12.88,13.28],["to",13.28,13.56],["look",13.56,13.68]]},{"start":13.68,"end":65.65,"text":"at questions 21 to 26. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 26.","words":[["at",13.68,13.82],["questions",13.82,14.14],["21",14.14,14.92],["to",14.92,15.22],["26.",15.22,15.78],["Now",61.43,61.77],["listen",61.77,62.11],["carefully",62.11,62.61],["and",62.61,63.21],["answer",63.21,63.57],["questions",63.57,63.97],["21",63.97,64.81],["to",64.81,65.09],["26.",65.09,65.65]]},{"start":69.07,"end":73.01,"text":"Hi, Janet. How are you getting on with the shampoo marketing project?","words":[["Hi,",69.07,69.61],["Janet.",69.77,69.97],["How",70.47,70.75],["are",70.75,70.85],["you",70.85,70.95],["getting",70.95,71.15],["on",71.15,71.37],["with",71.37,71.53],["the",71.53,71.69],["shampoo",71.69,71.97],["marketing",71.97,72.49],["project?",72.49,73.01]]},{"start":73.01,"end":79.71,"text":"Hi, Michael. It's interesting. I've read how shampoo marketing has developed over the","words":[["Hi,",73.01,74.11],["Michael.",74.23,74.45],["It's",75.03,75.53],["interesting.",75.53,76.13],["I've",76.79,77.21],["read",77.21,77.37],["how",77.37,77.63],["shampoo",77.63,78.07],["marketing",78.07,78.55],["has",78.55,78.87],["developed",78.87,79.25],["over",79.25,79.57],["the",79.57,79.71]]},{"start":79.71,"end":80.71,"text":"last hundred years.","words":[["last",79.71,80.01],["hundred",80.01,80.31],["years.",80.31,80.71]]},{"start":81.35,"end":83.75,"text":"Oh, I didn't think we needed to do that.","words":[["Oh,",81.35,81.81],["I",81.97,82.41],["didn't",82.41,82.59],["think",82.59,82.79],["we",82.79,82.95],["needed",82.95,83.15],["to",83.15,83.35],["do",83.35,83.47],["that.",83.47,83.75]]},{"start":84.53,"end":91.05,"text":"True, but I'm interested anyway. Basically, what was once sold as an economical way of","words":[["True,",84.53,85.01],["but",85.27,85.41],["I'm",85.41,85.71],["interested",85.71,86.09],["anyway.",86.09,86.51],["Basically,",87.19,87.63],["what",88.27,88.47],["was",88.47,88.71],["once",88.71,89.03],["sold",89.03,89.51],["as",89.51,89.81],["an",89.81,89.97],["economical",89.97,90.43],["way",90.43,90.89],["of",90.89,91.05]]},{"start":91.05,"end":94.65,"text":"getting your hair clean has evolved into a beauty product.","words":[["getting",91.05,91.27],["your",91.27,91.47],["hair",91.47,91.73],["clean",91.73,92.13],["has",92.13,92.69],["evolved",92.69,93.15],["into",93.15,93.57],["a",93.57,93.89],["beauty",93.89,94.09],["product.",94.09,94.65]]},{"start":94.89,"end":95.25,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",94.89,95.25]]},{"start":95.71,"end":102.23,"text":"And shampoo's interesting because it's a key influence in how we see ourselves. You've","words":[["And",95.71,96.11],["shampoo's",96.11,96.97],["interesting",96.97,97.55],["because",97.55,98.47],["it's",98.47,98.83],["a",98.83,98.93],["key",98.93,99.17],["influence",99.17,99.69],["in",99.69,100.01],["how",100.01,100.25],["we",100.25,100.41],["see",100.41,100.65],["ourselves.",100.65,101.17],["You've",101.73,102.23]]},{"start":102.23,"end":103.65,"text":"heard of bad hair days.","words":[["heard",102.23,102.39],["of",102.39,102.57],["bad",102.57,103.05],["hair",103.05,103.29],["days.",103.29,103.65]]},{"start":104.25,"end":108.43,"text":"When your hair looks bad, maybe you didn't wash it and you feel bad about it?","words":[["When",104.25,104.61],["your",104.61,104.89],["hair",104.89,105.09],["looks",105.09,105.29],["bad,",105.29,105.65],["maybe",106.11,106.35],["you",106.35,106.49],["didn't",106.49,106.61],["wash",106.61,106.97],["it",106.97,107.17],["and",107.17,107.31],["you",107.31,107.45],["feel",107.45,107.69],["bad",107.69,108.01],["about",108.01,108.19],["it?",108.19,108.43]]},{"start":109.15,"end":110.43,"text":"Heard of them, yes.","words":[["Heard",109.15,109.63],["of",109.63,109.77],["them,",109.77,110.01],["yes.",110.21,110.43]]},{"start":111.03,"end":111.51,"text":"Had one?","words":[["Had",111.03,111.31],["one?",111.31,111.51]]},{"start":112.09,"end":112.45,"text":"No.","words":[["No.",112.09,112.45]]},{"start":113.29,"end":114.11,"text":"Don't think they're real.","words":[["Don't",113.29,113.51],["think",113.51,113.63],["they're",113.63,113.81],["real.",113.81,114.11]]},{"start":114.75,"end":115.71,"text":"Bad hair days?","words":[["Bad",114.75,115.09],["hair",115.09,115.33],["days?",115.33,115.71]]},{"start":115.95,"end":116.45,"text":"Come on.","words":[["Come",115.95,116.19],["on.",116.19,116.45]]},{"start":116.89,"end":121.93,"text":"Well, whatever you want to call them, that's not what research from Yale is suggesting.","words":[["Well,",116.89,117.25],["whatever",117.35,117.55],["you",117.55,117.79],["want",117.79,117.97],["to",117.97,118.13],["call",118.13,118.37],["them,",118.37,118.63],["that's",119.05,119.45],["not",119.45,119.67],["what",119.67,119.91],["research",119.91,120.39],["from",120.39,120.79],["Yale",120.79,121.05],["is",121.05,121.41],["suggesting.",121.41,121.93]]},{"start":122.55,"end":127.25,"text":"They're not just imagined, and both sexes are equally affected by them.","words":[["They're",122.55,123.01],["not",123.01,123.25],["just",123.25,123.51],["imagined,",123.51,124.01],["and",124.63,124.85],["both",124.85,125.09],["sexes",125.09,125.67],["are",125.67,125.91],["equally",125.91,126.31],["affected",126.31,126.79],["by",126.79,127.05],["them.",127.05,127.25]]},{"start":127.25,"end":131.99,"text":"And when they happen, people tend to perform and feel worse than usual.","words":[["And",127.25,128.05],["when",128.05,128.19],["they",128.19,128.39],["happen,",128.39,128.73],["people",129.21,129.49],["tend",129.49,129.79],["to",129.79,129.97],["perform",129.97,130.41],["and",130.41,130.87],["feel",130.87,131.15],["worse",131.15,131.47],["than",131.47,131.65],["usual.",131.65,131.99]]},{"start":132.77,"end":133.21,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",132.77,133.21]]},{"start":133.91,"end":139.71,"text":"And I've been reading about shampoo ingredients, chemicals like sodium-loral sulfate,","words":[["And",133.91,134.27],["I've",134.27,134.49],["been",134.49,134.65],["reading",134.65,134.99],["about",134.99,135.29],["shampoo",135.29,135.87],["ingredients,",135.87,136.49],["chemicals",136.91,137.43],["like",137.43,137.91],["sodium",137.91,138.39],["-loral",138.39,138.85],["sulfate,",138.85,139.71]]},{"start":140.29,"end":141.91,"text":"methyl chloride.","words":[["methyl",140.29,141.05],["chloride.",141.05,141.91]]},{"start":142.85,"end":148.87,"text":"Many of the manufacturers tend to use these or others like them, though they keep it quiet.","words":[["Many",142.85,143.19],["of",143.19,143.37],["the",143.37,143.49],["manufacturers",143.49,144.15],["tend",144.15,144.89],["to",144.89,145.31],["use",145.31,145.61],["these",145.61,145.91],["or",145.91,146.43],["others",146.43,146.81],["like",146.81,147.15],["them,",147.15,147.49],["though",147.67,147.95],["they",147.95,148.11],["keep",148.11,148.35],["it",148.35,148.47],["quiet.",148.47,148.87]]},{"start":149.23,"end":149.51,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",149.23,149.51]]},{"start":149.87,"end":153.93,"text":"When it comes to the product packaging, they're strangely silent about it.","words":[["When",149.87,150.03],["it",150.03,150.13],["comes",150.13,150.37],["to",150.37,150.55],["the",150.55,150.67],["product",150.67,151.01],["packaging,",151.01,151.61],["they're",151.99,152.29],["strangely",152.29,152.83],["silent",152.83,153.35],["about",153.35,153.67],["it.",153.67,153.93]]},{"start":153.93,"end":159.11,"text":"Another area it would be interesting to investigate is the labeling on bottles.","words":[["Another",153.93,154.59],["area",154.59,155.13],["it",155.13,155.41],["would",155.41,155.51],["be",155.51,155.67],["interesting",155.67,156.17],["to",156.17,156.51],["investigate",156.51,157.05],["is",157.05,157.77],["the",157.77,157.95],["labeling",157.95,158.33],["on",158.33,158.67],["bottles.",158.67,159.11]]},{"start":159.75,"end":167.75,"text":"Apparently printing directly onto the bottles costs about 50% less than sticking a printed label on","words":[["Apparently",159.75,160.55],["printing",160.55,161.55],["directly",161.55,162.03],["onto",162.03,162.61],["the",162.61,162.83],["bottles",162.83,163.23],["costs",163.23,163.95],["about",163.95,164.25],["50",164.25,164.69],["%",164.69,165.07],["less",165.07,165.47],["than",165.47,166.05],["sticking",166.05,166.49],["a",166.49,166.77],["printed",166.77,167.09],["label",167.09,167.49],["on",167.49,167.75]]},{"start":167.75,"end":169.79,"text":"because it's a much quicker process.","words":[["because",167.75,168.29],["it's",168.29,168.57],["a",168.57,168.67],["much",168.67,168.91],["quicker",168.91,169.21],["process.",169.21,169.79]]},{"start":170.57,"end":177.89,"text":"But manufacturers are lukewarm about this because it doesn't enhance the visual impact of the bottle.","words":[["But",170.57,170.97],["manufacturers",170.97,171.93],["are",171.93,172.81],["lukewarm",172.81,173.53],["about",173.53,173.81],["this",173.81,174.19],["because",174.19,174.59],["it",174.59,174.81],["doesn't",174.81,175.19],["enhance",175.19,175.67],["the",175.67,175.99],["visual",175.99,176.39],["impact",176.39,176.87],["of",176.87,177.35],["the",177.35,177.51],["bottle.",177.51,177.89]]},{"start":178.41,"end":180.51,"text":"It comes across as a bit cheap.","words":[["It",178.41,178.79],["comes",178.79,179.11],["across",179.11,179.47],["as",179.47,179.95],["a",179.95,180.05],["bit",180.05,180.19],["cheap.",180.19,180.51]]},{"start":180.51,"end":188.55,"text":"Hmm. We need to think about environmental issues. I was surprised how little recycled plastic goes into the bottles.","words":[["Hmm.",180.51,181.19],["We",181.67,182.09],["need",182.09,182.27],["to",182.27,182.39],["think",182.39,182.59],["about",182.59,182.83],["environmental",182.83,183.33],["issues.",183.33,183.93],["I",184.59,184.95],["was",184.95,185.07],["surprised",185.07,185.41],["how",185.41,185.69],["little",185.69,186.05],["recycled",186.05,186.61],["plastic",186.61,187.33],["goes",187.33,187.83],["into",187.83,188.07],["the",188.07,188.19],["bottles.",188.19,188.55]]},{"start":189.11,"end":194.27,"text":"I think it's because light-colored plastic is more difficult to make from recycled stuff.","words":[["I",189.11,189.41],["think",189.41,189.59],["it's",189.59,189.85],["because",189.85,190.23],["light",190.23,190.75],["-colored",190.75,191.09],["plastic",191.09,191.69],["is",191.69,191.89],["more",191.89,192.07],["difficult",192.07,192.47],["to",192.47,192.83],["make",192.83,193.03],["from",193.03,193.25],["recycled",193.25,193.67],["stuff.",193.67,194.27]]},{"start":194.95,"end":201.11,"text":"Yeah, but manufacturers can make their packaging more environmentally friendly just by making it less heavy.","words":[["Yeah,",194.95,195.27],["but",195.41,195.65],["manufacturers",195.65,196.25],["can",196.25,196.73],["make",196.73,196.93],["their",196.93,197.09],["packaging",197.09,197.51],["more",197.51,197.83],["environmentally",197.83,198.53],["friendly",198.53,199.15],["just",199.15,199.73],["by",199.73,199.95],["making",199.95,200.29],["it",200.29,200.45],["less",200.45,200.67],["heavy.",200.67,201.11]]},{"start":201.59,"end":205.75,"text":"I'd like to find out whether some of them actually do when we do the research.","words":[["I'd",201.59,202.25],["like",202.25,202.37],["to",202.37,202.53],["find",202.53,202.79],["out",202.79,203.01],["whether",203.01,203.25],["some",203.25,203.61],["of",203.61,203.75],["them",203.75,203.85],["actually",203.85,204.19],["do",204.19,204.61],["when",204.61,204.93],["we",204.93,205.03],["do",205.03,205.19],["the",205.19,205.31],["research.",205.31,205.75]]},{"start":205.75,"end":212.25,"text":"Yes, that's worth looking into. Thinking about you as a customer, what's important when","words":[["Yes,",205.75,206.47],["that's",206.73,206.99],["worth",206.99,207.17],["looking",207.17,207.53],["into.",207.53,207.95],["Thinking",208.63,209.07],["about",209.07,209.43],["you",209.43,209.63],["as",209.63,209.75],["a",209.75,209.87],["customer,",209.87,210.29],["what's",210.97,211.25],["important",211.25,211.73],["when",211.73,212.25]]},{"start":212.25,"end":213.27,"text":"choosing shampoo?","words":[["choosing",212.25,212.75],["shampoo?",212.75,213.27]]},{"start":214.51,"end":221.65,"text":"I'm always wary of special offers. When something's flagged as being half price, it rarely is","words":[["I'm",214.51,215.15],["always",215.15,215.57],["wary",215.57,215.93],["of",215.93,216.09],["special",216.09,216.35],["offers.",216.35,216.83],["When",217.53,217.73],["something's",217.73,218.19],["flagged",218.19,218.75],["as",218.75,218.85],["being",218.85,219.11],["half",219.11,219.61],["price,",219.61,219.99],["it",220.73,220.87],["rarely",220.87,221.19],["is",221.19,221.65]]},{"start":221.65,"end":227.53,"text":"really. But if there's a make I've never seen before, I'm usually up for giving it","words":[["really.",221.65,221.99],["But",222.99,223.23],["if",223.23,223.43],["there's",223.43,224.07],["a",224.07,224.23],["make",224.23,224.51],["I've",224.51,224.89],["never",224.89,2