 and identify what sort of psychological response each one is trying to get from the","words":[["And",274.34,274.8],["try",274.8,275.24],["and",275.24,275.54],["identify",275.54,276.14],["what",276.14,276.9],["sort",276.9,277.34],["of",277.34,277.6],["psychological",277.6,278.18],["response",278.18,279.16],["each",279.16,279.54],["one",279.54,279.82],["is",279.82,280.06],["trying",280.06,280.3],["to",280.3,280.48],["get",280.48,280.64],["from",280.64,280.88],["the",280.88,281.02]]},{"start":281.02,"end":281.28,"text":"viewer.","words":[["viewer.",281.02,281.28]]},{"start":281.8,"end":282.26,"text":"Okay.","words":[["Okay.",281.8,282.26]]},{"start":282.84,"end":284.04,"text":"What about Zing?","words":[["What",282.84,283.12],["about",283.12,283.5],["Zing?",283.5,284.04]]},{"start":284.04,"end":288.94,"text":"Well, it'd probably appeal equally to men and women.","words":[["Well,",284.04,284.96],["it'd",285.48,285.86],["probably",285.86,286.68],["appeal",286.68,287.34],["equally",287.34,287.9],["to",287.9,288.2],["men",288.2,288.48],["and",288.48,288.6],["women.",288.6,288.94]]},{"start":289.6,"end":295.78,"text":"In the ad, we see this happy family, lovely home, healthy, good-looking children.","words":[["In",289.6,289.88],["the",289.88,290.02],["ad,",290.02,290.46],["we",290.62,290.72],["see",290.72,290.98],["this",290.98,291.3],["happy",291.3,291.76],["family,",291.76,292.22],["lovely",292.74,293.06],["home,",293.06,293.74],["healthy,",294.08,294.5],["good",294.72,294.86],["-looking",294.86,295.04],["children.",295.04,295.78]]},{"start":296.28,"end":297.58,"text":"With clean hair.","words":[["With",296.28,296.58],["clean",296.58,297.12],["hair.",297.12,297.58]]},{"start":298.08,"end":299.36,"text":"Obviously, yes.","words":[["Obviously,",298.08,298.76],["yes.",298.96,299.36]]},{"start":300.2,"end":307.42,"text":"And I think we're supposed to watch the ad and think, wow, if only my life was like","words":[["And",300.2,300.44],["I",300.44,300.78],["think",300.78,301.2